		["{npc:14529}, a human, stands in the west of the {zone:1428}. Talk to him and he becomes {npc:14534}. Alone, without your pet."] = "{npc:14529}, un humano, está en el oeste de {zone:1428}. Habla con él y se convierte en {npc:14534}. Solo y sin tu mascota.",
